@startuml
' ============================================================
' UC-09: Request Withdrawal - Sequence Diagram
' ============================================================

title UC-09: Request Withdrawal

actor User
participant "Wallet UI" as UI
participant "Wallet API" as API
database "Wallet DB" as DB
participant "Admin" as Admin
participant "Payment Gateway" as PG
participant "LOG Service" as LOG

== Request Withdrawal ==

User -> UI: Enter withdrawal amount & select method
UI -> API: POST /wallet/withdraw { amount, method_id }
API -> API: Validate amount & check limits
API -> DB: SELECT balance FROM wallet_wallets
DB --> API: Current balance

API -> DB: INSERT wallet_payout_requests (status: pending)
API -> DB: UPDATE wallet_wallets SET frozen_amount = frozen_amount + amount
API -> LOG: Log withdrawal request
LOG --> API: Logged

API --> UI: 200 OK { request_id, status: 'pending' }
UI --> User: "Withdrawal pending approval"

== Admin Approval ==

Admin -> API: GET /admin/wallet/payouts?status=pending
API --> Admin: List of pending payouts

Admin -> API: PATCH /admin/wallet/payouts/:id { status: 'approved' }
API -> DB: UPDATE wallet_payout_requests SET status = 'approved'
API -> PG: Process payout { amount, bank_account }
PG --> API: Payout processed

API -> DB: UPDATE wallet_payout_requests SET status = 'completed'
API -> DB: UPDATE wallet_wallets SET balance = balance - amount, frozen_amount = frozen_amount - amount
API -> LOG: Log payout completed
LOG --> API: Logged

API --> Admin: 200 OK { status: 'completed' }
Admin --> User: "Withdrawal completed"

@enduml